  "pantry.md": "# Pantry\n\nLong-life items you have at home (spices, oil, canned goods).\n\n- olive oil\n- salt, pepper, paprika, cumin, oregano\n",
  "profile.md": "# Household profile\n\nWrite freely — Claude reads this whole file before every suggestion.\n\n## Who eats\n- Two adults, office jobs, little exercise.\n\n## Goals\n- Lose weight slowly, stay full. Enough protein.\n\n## Medical / intolerances (always wins)\n- (e.g. lactose intolerance, insulin resistance: low GI, starch last)\n\n## Likes\n- Cheesy bakes, Mediterranean food, spicy is fine.\n\n## Dislikes\n- Mushrooms (never).\n\n## Kitchen\n- 1 oven with 2 racks, 1 sheet pan, 2 baking dishes, 1 large non-stick pan, pots.\n- Prep day may take about 75 minutes.\n\n## Shopping\n- Prefer one store. Budget see household.toml.\n"
